{"about_the_game":"Gorb's family has a <strong>special destiny</strong>. When his mom catches him recording an embarrassing <strong>dance tutorial</strong>, she knows that he is ready. She hands him a <strong>magic ribbon</strong> that can open <strong>portals</strong> and sends him to space. He must now travel through the galaxy and defeat his opponents... in epic <strong>DANCE BATTLES</strong>!<br><br>Portal to the Cosmobeat is a <strong>narrative-driven Dance Game</strong> featuring <strong>unconventional movement controls</strong>.<br>Use the keys on your keyboard to select a limb of your choice and now... move your mouse to dance. Sounds easy to you? Prove it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/3b7177d085e85dd074952c13fba3295d.avif?t=1761751616\" width=620 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/2a352287431433a1db67c41a50fa7243.poster.avif?t=1761751616\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/2a352287431433a1db67c41a50fa7243.webm?t=1761751616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064980/extras/2a352287431433a1db67c41a50fa7243.mp4?t=1761751616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Open portals with your magic ribbon and travel through the galaxy.<br>You will <strong>challenge</strong> the best <strong>dancers</strong> in the universe while listening to the <strong>freshest beats</strong>!<br></li><li>Currently, the game contains one <strong>Level</strong> (aside from our immersive tutorial), featuring<strong> two unique Techno-inspired tracks</strong>, which are gonna get stuck in your head.</li></ul><br><span class=\